SUMMARY:Winters Harvest Fest
DESCRIPTION:Join us in Downtown Winters to celebrate the Fall Harvest. Enjoy live music\, classic car show\, food & drink specials\, a local vendor fair\, our annual Spooktacular Fun Run\, and other fun activities for the whole family! \nFriday\, October 23rd\, 5:30-9:30PM: Downtown activities include live music\, food & drinks\, trick or treating\, pumpkin painting\, kids games and more. \nSaturday\, October 24th\, 10AM-2PM: Open air street market with local merchants\, live music and food. \nSunday\, October 25th\, 9AM-1PM: Farmers market\, live music and Spooktacular Fun Run \nFor more information click here.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/winters-harvest-fest/2026-10-25/
LOCATION:Downtown Winters\, Main Street\, Winters\, CA\, 95694\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/IMG_8660-scaled.jpeg
END:VEVENT
