SUMMARY:Wine Blending at Country Roads Wine Cellars
DESCRIPTION:Join Country Roads Wine Cellars for this 3-4 hour event where you create your own personal red wine blend. A winemaker will guide you through tasting and assessing the base wines\, setting up and assessing your own blending trials and bottling\, corking and labeling three 750ml bottles to take home. \n$95 per person non wine club members \n$65 per person for wine club members \nCountry Roads Wine Cellars is located within the Old Sugar Mill in Clarksburg\, CA.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/wine-blending-at-country-roads-wine-cellars/2026-10-25/
LOCATION:old sugar mill\, 35265 Willow Ave\, Clarksburg\, 95612\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Wine-glasses_web.jpg
END:VEVENT
