SUMMARY:Tom and the Broken Hearts at Hotel Winters
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Hotel Winters on Sunday\, October 25th for Tom and the Broken Hearts\, a Tom Petty tribute presented by Winters Live. \nGather your friends and enjoy an evening of live music\, then make the night even better with an overnight stay at Hotel Winters. Stay steps from the show\, skip the drive home\, and wake up to a relaxing morning in Winters. Book your stay today. \nDoors open at 1PM with food available from Carboni’s and bar open throughout the concert. \nTickets are $35 general admission or $45 VIP with reserved table seating in premium viewing area\, to purchase click here.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/tom-and-the-broken-hearts/
LOCATION:Hotel Winters\, 12 Abbey Street\, Winters\, CA\, 95694\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Tom-and-the-Broken-Hearts-Poster-Final.png
END:VEVENT
