UID:10014881-1793041200-1793048400@visityolo.com
SUMMARY:Renegade Orchestra at Davis Odd Fellows
DESCRIPTION:Renegade Orchestra in Davis – The Beauty of a Symphony\, the Soul of a Rock Band \nThe Renegade Orchestra is the bay area’s most rock and roll symphony. Is it a rock band? Is it an orchestra? Who knows? But it’s definitely the best of both worlds. The pure unbridled fury of some of the bay area’s top orchestra players unleashed on classic rock songs backed up by a hard-hitting rhythm section. \nThe Renegade Orchestra will be performing at Davis Odd Fellows\, which is located right in downtown\, and is a comfortable and casual hall with great views of the stage. The Renegade Orchestra will rock out to classic songs from Hendrix to Metallica and from Bowie to Zeppelin. \nAt this show\, the Renegade Orchestra will present a comfortable\, but lively show featuring around top bay area string players combined with a driving rhythm section\, all committed to having a relaxed and rocking time. If there is something you hate about orchestra concerts\, this is the opposite. \n“Classical Rebels.” The Bohemian \n“The Renegade Orchestra would rather tackle Hendrix than Handel.” Mercury News \n  \nRenegade Orchestra at Davis Odd Fellows \n415 2nd Street \nDavis\, CA 95616 \nOct 16 at 7 pm \nTickets: $25 at RenegadeOrchestra.com
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/renegade-orchestra-at-davis-odd-fellows/
LOCATION:Davis Odd Fellows Hall\, 415 2nd Street\, Davis\, 95616\, United States
END:VEVENT
