SUMMARY:Figure Drawing Group
DESCRIPTION:Figure Drawing Group in Davis \nWednesday\, October 28\, 6:30-9 PM \n$15 Members\, $22 Non-Members | Limited to 10 participants \nRegistration & payment is required in advance through the Pence’s website. \n  \nWe hold self-guided figure drawing sessions with a nude model every 2nd & 4th Wednesday of the month\, from 6:30–9 PM. This group is for both experienced artists and amateurs to have an opportunity to draw from the nude model. If you have never drawn from a live model before and would like to join us\, you are very welcome! People of all skill levels\, ages 18 and up\, are welcome and encouraged to join. \n  \nThis is not a class\, and no instruction is provided. The atmosphere is relaxed and non-competitive. Bring your own art materials\, and we’ll provide a comfortable place to sketch or paint live models in our upstairs classroom space. Participants will work independently through a warm up with shorter poses and longer\, twenty-minute poses. A staff member will be on-site to facilitate the group and to answer questions. \n  \nRegister here: https://pencegallery.org/education/programs/figure-drawing/ \n  \nQuestions? Email Yuuki at pencegalleryassociate@gmail.com. \n  \nImage: drawing by Deziree Seidner
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/figure-drawing-group/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/IMG_2036-copy.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencesocialmedia@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
