SUMMARY:Mariachi Bonitas Live at The HIVE
DESCRIPTION:Live at The HIVE presents Mariachi Bonitas during an outdoor concert. Doors at 5:30pm; Music at 6:30pm. \nChanging the narrative of mariachi in Sacramento and beyond\, Mariachi Bonitas de Dinorah Klingler is redefining what it means to be mariachi. \nEnjoy a seasonal menu\, craft beverages and complimentary honey tasting at northern California’s largest honey and mead tasting room. \nPay what you can cover charge: $0-$20/person. Family and dog friendly. All ages welcome. No outside food or drinks.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/mariachi-bonitas-live-at-the-hive-2/
LOCATION:The HIVE / Z Specialty Food\, The HIVE Tasting Room and Kitchen
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Mariachi-Bonitas.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="The HIVE / Z Specialty Food":MAILTO:events@zspecialtyfood.com
END:VEVENT
